{"id":"conv_04388","context":"A retired traveler shares prefecture memories with a uni student","ambient":"office_quiet_low","cast":["hiroshi_elder","ren_uni"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"When I was young, I took the night train from Sendai Station and traveled all around Tohoku.","jp":"若い頃はね、仙台駅から夜行列車に乗って、東北をぐるっと旅したものだよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,4,5,8,19,20,21,40,68,411,732,1055,1103,1217,3305,3365,4504,4781,4924,5879,14041,16498],"jpTokens":[{"s":"若い","r":"わかい","w":1055},{"s":"頃","r":"ころ","w":411},{"s":"はね","w":5879},{"s":"、"},{"s":"仙台","r":"せんだい","w":4504},{"s":"駅","r":"えき","w":732},{"s":"から","w":20},{"s":"夜行","r":"やこう","w":16498},{"s":"列車","r":"れっしゃ","w":3365},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"乗っ","r":"のっ","w":3305},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"東北","r":"とうほく","w":4924},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"ぐるっと"},{"s":"旅","r":"たび","w":1103},{"s":"し","w":19},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"もの","w":40},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Wow, the night train? Did you also venture into Fukushima and Yamagata prefectures?","jp":"へえ、夜行列車ですか。福島県や山形県にも足を延ばされたんですか?","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,5,8,11,16,17,26,42,58,322,775,3365,5182,5964,5999,16498,16864,17752],"jpTokens":[{"s":"へえ","w":16864},{"s":"、"},{"s":"夜行","r":"やこう","w":16498},{"s":"列車","r":"れっしゃ","w":3365},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"。"},{"s":"福島","r":"ふくしま","w":5182},{"s":"県","r":"けん","w":322},{"s":"や","w":42},{"s":"山形","r":"やまがた","w":5999},{"s":"県","r":"けん","w":322},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"足","r":"あし","w":775},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"延ばさ","r":"のばさ"},{"s":"れ","w":58},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"?"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Of course. The Fukushima peaches were truly sweet, and I still can't forget the night I soaked in a Yamagata hot spring.","jp":"もちろんさ。福島の桃は本当に甘くてね、山形の温泉に浸かった夜は今でも忘れられん。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"wor